			{%- assign spotsLeft = partition.Limit | Minus: partition.Filled -%}
			{%- comment -%}
				ROCK-FOODPACK: this is the pack-session (leaf) picker in CardWizardMode "Multiple".
				The role is already chosen by the time this renders, and it is parentPartition, so
				each session row can show what that role's window actually is.

				Session start comes from the pack-session Defined Value's EXISTING "DateTime" attribute,
				so no new per-slot field is needed and there is nothing to keep in sync. Session end is
				derived as start + length, where length is packSessionLengthMinutes from the block Lava,
				overridable per session by a SessionLengthMinutes attribute if one session runs long.

				Three tiers, best available wins:
				  1. Computed window - needs ShiftAnchor / ShiftOffsetMinutes / ShiftLengthMinutes on
				     the Group Type Role. Prints a real clock range per session.
				  2. ScheduleNote text, repeated per row. Only when showNoteOnEveryRow is 'true',
				     since the note is already in the alert at the top of this slide.
				  3. Nothing.

				shiftText MUST be reset every iteration - PartitionList is included once per session
				inside Partition.lava's loop and DotLiquid keeps assigns across iterations, so a stale
				value would bleed onto later rows.
			{%- endcomment -%}
			{%- assign shiftText = '' -%}
			{%- if parentPartition.PartitionType == 'Role' -%}
				{%- assign roleEntity = parentPartition.Entity -%}
				{%- assign shiftAnchor = roleEntity | Attribute:'ShiftAnchor','RawValue' -%}
				{%- assign shiftOffset = roleEntity | Attribute:'ShiftOffsetMinutes','RawValue' | AsInteger -%}
				{%- assign shiftLength = roleEntity | Attribute:'ShiftLengthMinutes','RawValue' | AsInteger -%}
				{%- assign sessionStart = partition.Entity | Attribute:'DateTime','RawValue' -%}
				{%- if shiftLength > 0 and sessionStart != '' and sessionStart != empty -%}
					{%- assign sessionLength = partition.Entity | Attribute:'SessionLengthMinutes','RawValue' | AsInteger -%}
					{%- if sessionLength <= 0 -%}
						{%- assign sessionLength = packSessionLengthMinutes | AsInteger -%}
					{%- endif -%}
					{%- if shiftAnchor == 'SessionEnd' -%}
						{%- assign anchorTime = sessionStart | DateAdd: sessionLength, 'm' -%}
					{%- else -%}
						{%- assign anchorTime = sessionStart -%}
					{%- endif -%}
					{%- assign shiftStart = anchorTime | DateAdd: shiftOffset, 'm' -%}
					{%- assign shiftEnd = shiftStart | DateAdd: shiftLength, 'm' -%}
					{%- capture shiftText -%}Your shift: {{ shiftStart | Date:'h:mm tt' }} &ndash; {{ shiftEnd | Date:'h:mm tt' }}{%- endcapture -%}
				{%- endif -%}
				{%- if shiftText == '' and showNoteOnEveryRow == 'true' -%}
					{%- assign roleNote = roleEntity | Attribute:'ScheduleNote' -%}
					{%- if roleNote != '' and roleNote != empty -%}
						{%- capture shiftText -%}{{ roleNote }}{%- endcapture -%}
					{%- endif -%}
				{%- endif -%}
			{%- endif -%}
			{% if partition.Limit != 0 %}
				<div class="col-md-10 col-md-offset-1 col-lg-8 col-lg-offset-2">
					<div class="clearfix">
						<div class="check">
							<label>
								<input type="checkbox" name="{{partition.ParameterName}}" value="{{partition.Entity.Guid}}" {% if partition.Limit > 0 and spotsLeft <= 0 %}disabled="true"{% endif %} />
								<div class="icon-box"><i class="fa fa-check"></i></div>
								<h3{% if  partition.Limit > 0 and spotsLeft <= 0 %} style="text-decoration: line-through"{% endif %}><strong><i>{{partition.Entity.Name}}{{partition.Entity.Value}}</i></strong><span class="hidden-xs hidden-sm spots-left"> - <small>{% if spotsLeft <= 0 %}Full{% elseif partition.Limit == null %}Unlimited{% else %}{{spotsLeft}} {{ 'Spot' | PluralizeForQuantity:spotsLeft }} Remaining{% endif %}</small></span></h3>
							</label>
							<div class="hidden-md hidden-lg" style="margin: -20px 0px 0px 75px">{% if spotsLeft <= 0 %}Full{% elseif partition.Limit == null %}Unlimited{% else %}{{spotsLeft}} {{ 'Spot' | PluralizeForQuantity:spotsLeft }} Remaining{% endif %}</div>
							{% if shiftText != '' %}
								<div class="text-muted" style="margin: 4px 0px 0px 75px; font-size: 13px;"><i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i> {{ shiftText }}</div>
							{% endif %}
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			{% endif %}
